qt5 can fetch the published Slackware patch-source tarball directly.

If you need to regenerate the snapshot tarball locally instead, run:

    ./fetch_sources.sh

That script clones the Qt 5.15 source tree and creates the expected
qt-everywhere-src-5.15.3_20220318_e507d3e5.tar.lz tarball used by
the package.

Build the package with:

    fakeroot slkbuild -X
